CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar -- class implementing curves on the moduli space of stable n-pointed genus zero curves
*********************************************************************************************************************

Description
===========

This class represents curve classes in $ NS_1(\bar{M}_{0,n}) $.  A curve class
is just a linear combination of F-curves.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L= { {{{1,2},{3},{4},{5}},1}, {{{1,3},{2},{4},{5}},1} };                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : curveClassRepresentativeM0nbar(5,L)                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar{"CurveExpression" => HashTable{{{1, 2},  |
|                                                                   {{1, 3},  |
|                                    "NumberOfMarkedPoints" => 5              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar                                          |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{3}, {4}, {5}} => 1}}                                                        |
|{2}, {4}, {5}} => 1                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

