CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar + CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar -- add two curve class representatives on M0nbar
****************************************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note +: (Macaulay2Doc)+,
  * Usage: 
        C1+C2
  * Inputs:
      * C1, an instance of the type *note CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar:
