        CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar,,
  * Outputs:
      * C3, an instance of the type *note DivisorClassRepresentativeM0nbar:
        DivisorClassRepresentativeM0nbar,,

Description
===========

This function adds two curve class representatives on M0nbar.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L1= { {{{1,2},{3},{4},{5}},1}, {{{1,3},{2},{4},{5}},1} };               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C1=curveClassRepresentativeM0nbar(5,L1);                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : L2= { {{{2,1},{3},{4},{5}},2}, {{{1,4},{2},{3},{5}},1} };               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : C2=curveClassRepresentativeM0nbar(5,L2);                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C1+C2                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar{"CurveExpression" => HashTable{{{1, 2},  |
|                                                                   {{1, 3},  |
|                                                                   {{1, 4},  |
|                                    "NumberOfMarkedPoints" => 5              |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar                                          |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{3}, {4}, {5}} => 3}}                                                        |
|{2}, {4}, {5}} => 1                                                          |
|{2}, {3}, {5}} => 1                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

