  * "divisorClassRepresentativeM0nbar(ZZ,List)"
  * *note divisorClassRepresentativeM0nbar(ZZ,HashTable):
    divisorClassRepresentativeM0nbar_lpZZ_cmHashTable_rp, -- creates an object
    of type DivisorClassRepresentativeM0nbar

