FcurvesOfGivenShape -- a list of the F-curves with the given shape
******************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        FcurvesOfGivenShape(a,b,c,d)
  * Inputs:
      * a, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * b, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * c, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

Given four positive integers $a$, $b$, $c$, $d$ with $a+b+c+d=n$, this function
lists the F-curves $F_{I_1,I_2,I_3,I_4}$ with $\#I_1=a$,  $\#I_2=b$,
$\#I_3=c$,  $\#I_4=d$.

