        CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar,,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, 

Description
===========

This function tests whether the coefficients in an object of type
CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar are all nonnegative.

Warning: this function tests only the input representative of a curve class.
That is, it answers whether the input is an effective expression, not whether
there exists an effective expression equivalent to the input.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L1= { {{{2,1},{3},{4},{5}},-2}, {{{1,3},{2},{4},{5}},-7},               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{{{1,4},{2},{3},{5}},1}};                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C1=curveClassRepresentativeM0nbar(5,L1);                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isEffectiveExpression(C1)                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : L2={ {{{2,1},{3},{4},{5}},2}, {{{1,3},{2},{4},{5}},7},                  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{{{1,4},{2},{3},{5}},1}};                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C2=curveClassRepresentativeM0nbar(5,L2);                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : isEffectiveExpression(C2)                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

