isEquivalent -- check whether two curve class representatives are numerically equivalent
****************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isEquivalent(C1,C2)
  * Inputs:
      * C1, an instance of the type *note CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar:
        CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar,,
