permute -- compute the image of a curve class representative under a permutation of the marked points
*****************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        permute(sigma,C)
  * Inputs:
      * sigma, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
      * C, an instance of the type *note CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar:
        CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar,,
  * Outputs:
      * C2, an instance of the type *note CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar:
        CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar,,

Description
===========

The symmetric group $S_n$ acts on $\bar{M}_{0,n}$ by permuting the marked
points.

This function computes the image of a curve class representative $C$ under a
permutation $\sigma$ of the marked points.

Enter $\sigma$ as a list $\{ \sigma(1),\sigma(2),\ldots,\sigma(n)\}$.  Cycle
class notation is not supported for this function.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : L= { {{{2,1},{3},{4},{5}},-2}, {{{1,3},{2},{4},{5}},-7},                |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{{{1,4},{2},{3},{5}},1}};                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C=curveClassRepresentativeM0nbar(5,L);                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : permute({5,2,1,3,4}, C)                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar{"CurveExpression" => HashTable{{{1, 5}, {|
|                                                                   {{1}, {2, |
|                                                                   {{1}, {2},|
|                                    "NumberOfMarkedPoints" => 5              |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : CurveClassRepresentativeM0nbar                                          |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|2}, {3}, {4}} => -7}}                                                        |
|5}, {3}, {4}} => -2                                                          |
| {3, 5}, {4}} => 1                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

